\section{Thermal Envelope}
%===========================================================

\subsection{Cooling Model}

Let $Q_{\text{GPU}}$ be the heat load per GPU and $N_{\text{GPU}} = 8$.

\[
Q_{\text{blade}} = N_{\text{GPU}} \cdot Q_{\text{GPU}} + Q_{\text{CPU}} + Q_{\text{VRM}}
\]

Two-phase D2C cooling maintains:

\[
T_{\text{die}} \le 68^\circ\text{C}
\]

Coolant supply:

\[
T_{\text{sup}} = 32^\circ\text{C}
\]

\subsection{Cabinet Thermal Load}

\[
Q_{\text{cabinet}} = 100\,\text{kW} \text{ to } 400\,\text{kW}
\]

