\section{Security Enclave}
%===========================================================

The hardware security module (HSM) executes post-quantum primitives:

\begin{itemize}
    \item Kyber-1024 (KEM)
    \item Dilithium5 (Signature)
\end{itemize}

The enclave is isolated from host memory and GPU memory, with dedicated 
cryptographic SRAM and tamper-resistant logic.

